# A placeholder lemma which is trivially true (it's also FifoDepthCheck_A in rram_ctrl.sv), but lets
# us check that the tooling works
lemma example
  FifoDepthCheck: have ((WrFifoDepth <= MaxFifoDepth) &
                        (RdFifoDepth <= MaxFifoDepth))



